# Input

```scss
$tone:  /* theme */rebeccapurple ;
.single{color:  $tone   ;width:calc(100% - #{$gutter});}

.grid{grid-template-columns:[full-start] minmax($gutter,1fr)
 [main-start] minmax(20ch, $content-width) [main-end];
grid-template-areas: // rows
 "#{$header} #{$header}"
 "sidebar #{$content}";}

.groups{box-shadow:$x   $y 3px $tone,$spread 5px 6px black;
background:url($first-image) center/cover no-repeat,url($second-image) right/contain repeat-x;}

.comments{box-shadow:$x/* horizontal */$y 3px $tone,/* layer */$spread 5px 6px black;
margin:$top // vertical spacing
 $right  $bottom  $left;}

.fill{animation:$exceptionally-long-animation-name 1200ms cubic-bezier(0.125,0.875,0.625,1) 250ms infinite alternate both running;
font:italic small-caps 700 condensed #{$size}/#{$line-height} "A Very Long Font Family Name",sans-serif;}

```


# Formatted

```scss
$tone: /* theme */ rebeccapurple;
.single {
	color: $tone;
	width: calc(100% - #{$gutter});
}

.grid {
	grid-template-columns:
		[full-start] minmax($gutter, 1fr)
		[main-start] minmax(20ch, $content-width) [main-end];
	grid-template-areas: // rows
		"#{$header} #{$header}"
		"sidebar #{$content}";
}

.groups {
	box-shadow: $x $y 3px $tone, $spread 5px 6px black;
	background:
		url($first-image) center / cover no-repeat,
		url($second-image) right / contain repeat-x;
}

.comments {
	box-shadow:
		$x /* horizontal */ $y 3px $tone,
		/* layer */ $spread 5px 6px black;
	margin: $top // vertical spacing
		$right $bottom $left;
}

.fill {
	animation: $exceptionally-long-animation-name 1200ms
		cubic-bezier(0.125, 0.875, 0.625, 1) 250ms infinite alternate both running;
	font:
		italic small-caps 700 condensed #{$size} / #{$line-height}
			"A Very Long Font Family Name",
		sans-serif;
}

```
